## Consequence

This closes support 10 only. On authoritative main before this contribution, exact exclusions are committed for supports 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, and 12. Separate pushed branches contain exclusions for supports 6 through 9. If all of those branch results are integrated together with this certificate, the remaining two-selected-singleton supports are 11 and 13.

This does not close the full two-singleton profile, the full `D=-1,p=2` branch, or Erdos Problem #99.
